+    "\n",
+    "**Root cause.** `card_chargeback_rate` was computed as one number per card over the whole training table (notebook 01, cell 8). For every training row it therefore included the row's own chargeback, filed 20–90 days after the transaction. At serving time that dispute does not exist. Training and serving computed different features under one name: the offline number measured the leak, and the shadow number measured a model that had learned to depend on it.\n",
